_pdbx_nmr_refine.details            
;THE RESTRAINED REGULARIZED MEAN STRUCTURE IS PRESENTED IN
ENTRY 2STW AND 25 STRUCTURES ARE PRESENTED IN ENTRY 2STT.
IN 2STW THE LAST COLUMN REPRESENTS THE RMS OF THE 25
INDIVIDUAL SIMULATED ANNEALING STRUCTURES ABOUT THE MEAN
COORDINATE POSITIONS.  THE LAST COLUMN IN THE INDIVIDUAL SA
STRUCTURES HAS NO MEANING.  BEST FITTING TO GENERATE THE
AVERAGE STRUCTURE IS WITH RESPECT TO RESIDUES 24 - 105 OF
THE PROTEIN AND BASE PAIRS 1 - 17 OF THE DNA (RESIDUES 10 -
24 ARE DISORDERED IN SOLUTION).  RESIDUE 10 CORRESPONDS TO
RESIDUE 320 OF THE NATURAL SEQUENCE.  NOTE THE OCCUPANCY
FIELD HAS NO MEANING.
;
_pdbx_nmr_refine.software_ordinal   1 
